# Optional: base URL of the Telegram bot Worker (see docs/telegram-bot-setup.md).
# When set at build time, videos published through the bot appear in the
# catalogue. This is a public URL (it ships in the site's JS), not a secret.
# For GitHub Pages deploys, set it as a repository *variable* named
# VITE_TELEGRAM_FEED_URL instead of using this file.
# VITE_TELEGRAM_FEED_URL=https://afterdark-bot.yourname.workers.dev
